+
+## TDAI Host Routing
+
+Load this package with `skill_view`. If the manifest points to a supporting file, read that file with `skill_files_read`; do not install or execute source-repository dependencies for Task 1.
+
+Use when:
+- Validating screen reader compatibility
+- Testing ARIA implementations
+- Debugging assistive technology issues
+- Verifying form accessibility
+- Testing dynamic content announcements
+- Ensuring navigation accessibility
+
+Do not use when:
+- Don't assume one screen reader is enough
+- Don't ignore mobile
+- Don't test only the happy path
+- Don't skip dynamic content
+- Don't rely on visual testing
+
+The upstream technical workflow below is preserved unchanged.
